 Q-1: Implement NOT, AND, OR gates
Implement NOT, AND, OR gates using only NAND gates in HDL. Draw

the logic diagram for each and write the Boolean expression. Run the

provided test scripts and capture the simulation output.




NOT Gate

Logic Diagram
      +---+
in ---|   |
      | & |o--- out = in'
in ---|   |
      +---+
      (Nand)


HDL Implementation
CHIP Not {
    IN in;
    OUT out;

    PARTS:
    Nand(a=in, b=in, out=out);
}

AND Gate


Logic Diagram
     +---+             +---+
a ---|   |     w1      |   |
     | & |o-----+------| & |o--- out = a . b
b ---|   |      +------|   |
     +---+             +---+
    (Nand 1)          (Nand 2)


HDL Implementation
CHIP And {
    IN a, b;
    OUT out;

    PARTS:
    Nand(a=a, b=b, out=w1);
    Nand(a=w1, b=w1, out=out);
}



OR Gate


Logic Diagram
     +---+
a ---|   |   nota
     | & |o-------+
a ---|   |        |   +---+
     +---+        +---|   |
                      | & |o--- out = a + b
     +---+        +---|   |
b ---|   |   notb |   +---+
     | & |o-------+
b ---|   |
     +---+


HDL Implementation
CHIP Or {
    IN a, b;
    OUT out;

    PARTS:
    Nand(a=a, b=a, out=nota);
    Nand(a=b, b=b, out=notb);
    Nand(a=nota, b=notb, out=out);
}


